WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.000 align:center
♪ under the cover of darkness, in Dissolving Memory Bridge, tense.

2
00:00:04.300 --> 00:00:06.300 align:center
Lyra: No! Not this one.

3
00:00:06.600 --> 00:00:08.600 align:center
Echo Shard: Pointless. Let it fall.

4
00:00:08.900 --> 00:00:09.900 align:center
Lyra: Never!

5
00:00:10.200 --> 00:00:11.200 align:center
Kael: Hold… tight.

6
00:00:12.500 --> 00:00:16.500 align:center
♪ under the cover of darkness, in Memory Bridge - Mid-span, desperate.

7
00:00:16.800 --> 00:00:18.800 align:center
Lyra: Faster. It's too fast!

8
00:00:19.100 --> 00:00:20.100 align:center
Loom of Oblivion: Inevitability. Accept.

9
00:00:20.400 --> 00:00:21.400 align:center
Lyra: No path. No...

10
00:00:21.700 --> 00:00:22.700 align:center
Kael: This… feeling. Again.

11
00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:29.000 align:center
♪ under the cover of darkness, in Edge of the Memory Bridge, urgent.

12
00:00:29.300 --> 00:00:30.300 align:center
Lyra: Only one way.

13
00:00:30.600 --> 00:00:31.600 align:center
Loom of Oblivion: Futility. End it.

14
00:00:31.900 --> 00:00:32.900 align:center
Kael: Don't… fall.

15
00:00:33.200 --> 00:00:34.200 align:center
Lyra: Never!

16
00:00:35.500 --> 00:00:37.500 align:center
♪ at dawn, in Crumbling Memory-Canyon, tense.

17
00:00:37.800 --> 00:00:39.800 align:center
Lyra: Loose rock. Too many.

18
00:00:40.100 --> 00:00:42.100 align:center
Echo Shard: Lost already. Just drift.

19
00:00:42.400 --> 00:00:44.400 align:center
Lyra: Not lost. Not yet.

20
00:00:44.700 --> 00:00:46.700 align:center
Kael: This place… it wants you.

21
00:00:47.1000 --> 00:00:51.1000 align:center
♪ in broad daylight, in Canyon Narrows - Ambush Point, urgent.

22
00:00:52.300 --> 00:00:54.300 align:center
Lyra: Behind me! Too many!

23
00:00:54.600 --> 00:00:56.600 align:center
Echo Shard: Give us the memory. Release it.

24
00:00:56.900 --> 00:00:58.900 align:center
Lyra: Never! Not this one!

25
00:00:59.200 --> 00:01:00.200 align:center
Kael: Careful… no!

26
00:01:01.500 --> 00:01:05.500 align:center
♪ in broad daylight, in Memory Cave - Temporary Shelter, dread.

27
00:01:05.800 --> 00:01:06.800 align:center
Lyra: Cover! Now!

28
00:01:07.100 --> 00:01:09.100 align:center
Loom of Oblivion: Nowhere to hide. All returns.

29
00:01:09.400 --> 00:01:11.400 align:center
Kael: Not safe. Never safe.

30
00:01:11.700 --> 00:01:13.700 align:center
Lyra: Just for a moment.

31
00:01:14.1000 --> 00:01:16.1000 align:center
♪ at dusk, in Crumbling Memory-Cliff, desperate.

32
00:01:17.300 --> 00:01:19.300 align:center
Lyra: Up. Must go up.

33
00:01:19.600 --> 00:01:20.600 align:center
Loom of Oblivion: Struggle prolongs. Yield.

34
00:01:20.900 --> 00:01:22.900 align:center
Kael: The edge… it breaks.

35
00:01:23.200 --> 00:01:24.200 align:center
Lyra: Almost there. Almost.

36
00:01:25.500 --> 00:01:29.500 align:center
♪ at dusk, in Cliff Summit - Loom's Barrier, dread.

37
00:01:29.800 --> 00:01:30.800 align:center
Lyra: Blocked. It's everywhere.

38
00:01:31.100 --> 00:01:33.100 align:center
Loom of Oblivion: No passage. Only return.

39
00:01:33.400 --> 00:01:35.400 align:center
Lyra: Think. There has to be…

40
00:01:35.700 --> 00:01:37.700 align:center
Kael: This trap… I know it.

41
00:01:38.1000 --> 00:01:43.1000 align:center
♪ under the cover of darkness, in Cliff Summit - Risky Ledge, urgent.

42
00:01:44.300 --> 00:01:46.300 align:center
Lyra: The ledge. It's too narrow.

43
00:01:46.600 --> 00:01:48.600 align:center
Kael: Don't risk it. Not with…

44
00:01:48.900 --> 00:01:50.900 align:center
Lyra: No other choice. Hold on.

45
00:01:51.200 --> 00:01:53.200 align:center
Loom of Oblivion: Foolish. The shard will break.

46
00:01:54.500 --> 00:01:59.500 align:center
♪ under the cover of darkness, in Cliff Summit - Loom's Retaliation, dread.

47
00:01:59.800 --> 00:02:01.800 align:center
Loom of Oblivion: Your burden. It will shatter.

48
00:02:02.100 --> 00:02:03.100 align:center
Lyra: No! My shield!

49
00:02:03.400 --> 00:02:04.400 align:center
Kael: Aaaagh! It burns!

50
00:02:04.700 --> 00:02:06.700 align:center
Lyra: Hold on! Don't let go!

51
00:02:07.1000 --> 00:02:12.1000 align:center
♪ under the cover of darkness, in Cliff Summit - Loom's Revelation, desperate.

52
00:02:13.300 --> 00:02:15.300 align:center
Lyra: What… what did you do?

53
00:02:15.600 --> 00:02:17.600 align:center
Loom of Oblivion: We cleansed it. Made it safe.

54
00:02:17.900 --> 00:02:19.900 align:center
Kael: It… remembers. Our purpose.

55
00:02:20.200 --> 00:02:22.200 align:center
Lyra: No! That's not you!

56
00:02:22.500 --> 00:02:25.500 align:center
Loom of Oblivion: Soon, you will understand. All of you.
